  "body": "Step inside to a welcoming entrance that opens directly into a bright and spacious living area, perfect for everyday family life. The kitchen and dining area are conveniently positioned for delicious meal preparation and entertaining. This level also features three well-proportioned bedrooms and a full bathroom, offering a comfortable and practical layout for family living.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, discover two additional bedrooms, a second living area, and a bathroom — ideal for teenagers, extended family, or potential boarder income. This versatile layout provides plenty of options to suit your lifestyle.\r\nThe fully fenced 476m² (more or less) section includes a low-maintenance garden, with off-street parking for up to two vehicles.\r\nLocated in sought-after school zones, including Sherwood Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, Long Bay College, and Rangitoto College, this home is perfect for families prioritising quality education.\r\n\r\nClose to parks, shopping, cafes, and Browns Bay Beach, this property offers a practical and family-friendly lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this don’t come often- Our motivated vendors are ready to sell, so act fast and make this exceptional home yours today!\r\n\r\n*No viewings until further notice, while the owners wait for the title.",
